SUMMARY:One Piece: Pirates Party
DTSTAMP:20260717T070211Z
DTSTART:20260717T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏴‍☠️ Join CCS and Luffy’s Corner for One Piece: Pirates Party! Whe
	ther you’re new to the ONE PIECE CARD GAME or just looking for a fun\, cas
	ual night with fellow NAKAMA\, come play\, meet the community\, and enjoy 
	pirate battles without the pressure of meta decks! \nThis event will cap a
	t 44 players\, so sign up while supplies last! \n  \n🗓️ : July 17th\, 2026 
	\n📍: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \n📝 Event Overview
	: \n\nFormat: Constructed\nTournament Structure: Single Elimination\nExpec
	ted Number of Rounds: 4 rounds\nEntry: $5\nOn-Site Registration\n\n  \n💰 P
	rize Pool: \n\nParticipation: Bandai Participation Pack\n\n  \n📋 Registrat
	ion Details: \n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration: 6:00 PM\nRound
	 1 Begins: 7:00 PM\n\n  \nAdditional Information:\nLeaders not Allowed:\nO
	P05-098 Enel (Yellow)\nOP09-001 Shanks (Red)\nOP11-041 Nami (Blue/Yellow)\
	nOP12-061 Donquixote Rosinante (Purple/Yellow)\nOP13-001 Monkey.D.Luffy (R
	ed/Green)\nOP13-002 Portgas.D.Ace (Red/Blue)\nOP13-079 Imu (Black)\nOP14-0
	20 Dracule Mihawk (Green)\nOP14-041 Boa Hancock (Blue/Yellow)\nOP15-002 Lu
	cy (Red/Blue)\nOP15-058 Enel (Purple)\nOP15-098 Monkey.D.Luffy (Yellow)\nO
	P16-022 Monkey.D.Luffy (Green/Blue)\nOP16-079 Yamato (Black)\nOP16-080 Mar
	shall.D.Teach (Black/Yellow)\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/one-piece-p
	irates-party/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/one-piece-pirates-party/
